   479	
   480	| Field | |
   481	|---|---|
   482	| **Status** | **Accepted (2026-08-08).** Owner ratified path A ("static deployment for now" — lean/config-driven, no AgentHost revival) from the [landing-surface reconciliation memo](issues/391/landing-surface-reconciliation.md) (PR #1153). |
